# Enables the shell linting this repository ships for everyone else. The block in
# `linters` is gated on this file existing; without it, ci-tools never ran
# shellcheck against its own scripts.
#
# `external-sources` is passed on the command line by `linters`, so it is not
# repeated here.

# Warn on constructs that are legal but usually mistakes, on top of the defaults.
enable=quote-safe-variables
enable=require-variable-braces
